```

An item may be highly liquid but extremely competitive.

## 8. Hot Path Requirement

This is critical.

Do NOT run comparable-sale SQL queries or heavy statistics after a new listing appears.

Use:

```text
PostgreSQL historical data
→ background market analytics
→ precomputed MarketValuationSnapshot
→ Redis/in-memory hot cache
```

Live path remains:

```text
new listing
→ normalized item ID
→ hot valuation lookup
→ profit/risk calculation
→ capture probability
→ Redis lock
→ purchase
```

No PostgreSQL history query in the purchase hot path.

